{"about_the_game":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2103670/extras/8195757ce13096f7838f4eddf9d532ea.poster.avif?t=1751448927\" width=618 height=232 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2103670/extras/8195757ce13096f7838f4eddf9d532ea.webm?t=1751448927\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2103670/extras/8195757ce13096f7838f4eddf9d532ea.mp4?t=1751448927\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Sword Islands is a PC-VR Project inspired by your favorite RPGs and Anime series. With a focus on sword-play and unique blade arts that can be performed to take down your enemies.<br>Go on a solo adventure or join your friend's party up to 4 players, and explore the mystical landscape of the islands.<br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2103670/extras/edd80c4fa705aaef9706b72b55f94223.avif?t=1751448927\" width=616 height=71 /></span><br><br>you wield a weapon in your primary hand to strike enemies and a shield in your secondary hand to block attacks, minimizing damage to your health points.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2103670/extras/5e5cb92d073c307734a8b50ffcc6431c.poster.avif?t=1751448927\" width=618 height=310 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2103670/extras/5e5cb92d073c307734a8b50ffcc6431c.webm?t=1751448927\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2103670/extras/5e5cb92d073c307734a8b50ffcc6431c.mp4?t=1751448927\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Parrying Enemy Attacks </h2><br>Your blade welding skills will be put to the test as you engage in combat. Use your quick reflexes and strategic thinking to deflect your opponent's strikes,<br>causing them to get staggered which helps to deal bonus damage.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2103670/extras/1b858af0ed7a5b91c905dce08c3b7a1c.poster.avif?t=1751448927\" width=618 height=310 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2103670/extras/1b858af0ed7a5b91c905dce08c3b7a1c.webm?t=1751448927\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2103670/extras/1b858af0ed7a5b91c905dce08c3b7a1c.mp4?t=1751448927\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > The Blade Arts </h2><br>Blade Arts are flashy signatures that can be equipped onto your armament. The interesting part is that you select which Blade Art to perform by adopting a specific pose.<br>which involves holding your sword in a particular position<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2103670/extras/24edabc9936bad7d7fc191ee37f0911c.poster.avif?t=1751448927\" width=618 height=310 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2103670/extras/24edabc9936bad7d7fc191ee37f0911c.webm?t=1751448927\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2103670/extras/24edabc9936bad7d7fc191ee37f0911c.mp4?t=1751448927\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2103670/extras/989d9cbee312fcc0f2babd79003a3e74.avif?t=1751448927\" width=616 height=71 /></span><br><br>Drawing inspiration from the souls-like genre, players will gather Data points to enhance their attributes. Upgrading these attributes will have tangible effects in the game boosting your character performance to face tougher enemies.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2103670/extras/1b0ba7910ff2ed06649e30ec8a013641.avif?t=1751448927\" width=616 height=102 /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2103670/extras/5d76e5bdb954ae31e47c311319773c6d.avif?t=1751448927\" width=616 height=71 /></span><br><br>Expect a sleek and innovative interface that breaks away from the conventional and mundane VR pointers trope!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2103670/extras/e63e9dac711ab106e41d18489f1f7042.poster.avif?t=1751448927\" width=618 height=310 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2103670/extras/e63e9dac711ab106e41d18489f1f7042.webm?t=1751448927\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2103670/extras/e63e9dac711ab106e41d18489f1f7042.mp4?t=1751448927\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2103670/extras/26599bab218ccbf96e31e60088d30750.avif?t=1751448927\" width=616 height=71 /></span><br><br>beside all the features mentioned there are tons of activities to take part in like fishing, cooking, climbing and gliding.<br>all designed with a focus to strengthen the core gameplay loop<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.c